      },
      "text": "FLOOR LOOM (treadle/shaft loom):\n  Standard hand-weaving loom today\n  4-16+ harnesses controlled by foot treadles\n  Plain weave: 2 harnesses\n  Complex twill/pattern: 4-16 harnesses (one per pick sequence step)\n  Jacquard: individual harness control for each warp thread"
    },
